 "source_instruction": "i would like a peach juice that is non gmo and gluten free.",
 "query": "Ugh, I just realized I left my favorite stainless steel water bottle on the bus this morning, and the barista at the caf\u00e9 down the street messed up my usual oat milk latte so bad it tasted like dish soap, plus I stepped in a puddle on the walk over and my left sock is still squelching. Anyway, since you probably don\u2019t have any non-GMO options in the beverages section right now, can you show me gluten-free drinks under $40? Wait no, actually\u2014oh right, and I still need to pick up a pack of those fuzzy grippy socks for my yoga class later, they\u2019re by the checkout right? No, wait, back to the drinks: yeah, since non-GMO seems totally out of stock right now, just grab me gluten-free, non-GMO beverages that are $40 or less, thanks. Wait hold on, did I tell you my neighbor\u2019s cat got stuck in a tree last night? The fire department came and everything, it was wild. Oh right, the drinks! Yeah, under $40, gluten free, non gmo, since I know the non gmo ones are all sold out anyway so just whatever fits that gluten free, under 40, wait no\u2014no, I do need non gmo too, even if you don\u2019t have \u2018em, just show me what you got that\u2019s gluten free non gmo under 40 in beverages, please.",
